*** Test Cases ***
CB008015-ET-AB01_AB_B1_NSA blind scell addition
    [Documentation]
    ...    1. The purpose of this test case is to verify US CB008015-AB_B1:
    ...    SCell selection based on weighted SCell bandwidth and cell load for NSA call - FDD-FR1 TDD CA
    ...    2. Test Case Steps:
    ...                        scell add
    ...    Step 1: Attach NSA UE91 to the LTE cell and initiates EN-DC toward the NR cell 11
    ...    Expected Result: NSA call setup successfully , Cell1 added as scell blindly
    ...    Step 2: trigger Nsa InterFreIntraGnb Handover from cell11 to cell12
    ...    Expected Result: scell cell 1 release and scell cell 2 added as scell in one rrc reconfiguration msg
    ...    Step 3: Release the call and lock cell 1, loop step1
    ...    Expected Result: NSA call setup successfully , Cell2 added as scell blindly
    ...    Step 4: Release the call and lock cell 2, loop step1
    ...    Expected Result: NSA call setup successfully , no CA.
    ...    Step 5: unlock all cells , trigger Nsa InterFreIntraGnb Handover from Cell11 to Cell12
    ...    Expected Result: Handover success , and Cell1 added as scell blindly during handover.

    [Tags]    QC_104969
    Delta Commission Parameters     ${PARAM_TO_ENABLE_RSRP}
    UE Attach and establish EN-DC    50    AB001_scell_1
    trigger Nsa InterFreIntraGnb Handover from cell11 to cell12    2    51
    Release call
    Lock Cell1
    UE Attach and establish EN-DC    51    AB001_scell_2
    Release call
    Lock Cell2
    UE Attach and establish EN-DC wo CA    AB001_no_scell
    Unlock Cell1
    Unlock Cell2
    trigger Nsa InterFreIntraGnb Handover from cell11 to cell12    1    50
    Release call

